          "text": "林晚问是谁",
          "timeline_ordinal": 7
        },
        {
          "source_type": "SOURCE_DIALOGUE",
          "speaker": "顾沉",
          "text": "也许是你自己",
          "timeline_ordinal": 8
        },
        {
          "source_type": "SOURCE_ACTION",
          "text": "两人同时听见门外铜铃响了一声，顾沉熄灭安全灯，拉着林晚躲到药水柜后。",
          "timeline_ordinal": 9
        },
        {
          "source_type": "SOURCE_ACTION",
          "text": "门缝下出现一双湿透的皮鞋。",
          "timeline_ordinal": 10
        },
        {
          "source_type": "SOURCE_ACTION",
          "text": "那人没有进门，只把一张车票塞进来。",
